# Scoped to api-dotnet/Dockerfile. Build context is the repo root, so these
# patterns match against repo-relative paths. BuildKit picks this file up
# automatically when building with `-f api-dotnet/Dockerfile`.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.git/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
.env
.env.local
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
ui/
api/
terraform/
aspire/Blog.AppHost/
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
